<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound o/n, one-week rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound o/n, one-week rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell on Tuesday in a slightly more liquid private-sector market to between eight and 8-7/8 percent from Monday's range of 8-1/4 and nine percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also fell to a range of 8-1/4 to nine percent from between 8-1/2 and nine percent, they added.</p>
<p>The bankers said that public-sector banks kept their official minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
